# GitHub Linguist
#
# The language bar should describe the site, not the corpus it indexes.
#
# Every template in public/templates/ is a self-contained document with its CSS
# and JS inlined, so Linguist attributes the whole file to HTML. The site's own
# source is ~14 KB of .astro and barely grows, so a couple of templates would
# put HTML permanently on top of the bar.
#
# linguist-vendored drops these from the language stats only. They stay tracked,
# browsable, diffable and searchable on GitHub.
public/templates/** linguist-vendored
